WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:00.001
.

3
01:51.439 --> 01:52.400
When I was seven,

4
01:53.480 --> 01:54.879
I had a very close friend.

5
01:55.760 --> 01:57.159
We were playing hide-and-seek back then.

6
01:57.560 --> 01:59.280
She followed me into an old courtyard,

7
01:59.319 --> 02:00.159
but as it happened,

8
02:01.079 --> 02:02.680
a fugitive was hiding there, too.

9
02:06.120 --> 02:08.479
I watched helplessly as she was hurt.

10
02:15.520 --> 02:16.000
That's why,

11
02:17.039 --> 02:18.240
on every mission,

12
02:20.240 --> 02:21.439
I never want you to get hurt.

13
02:23.919 --> 02:24.719
Listen to me.

14
02:25.159 --> 02:25.639
Don't go.

15
02:26.800 --> 02:28.159
I know you're looking out for me,

16
02:28.400 --> 02:29.280
but I can't accept that.

17
02:30.639 --> 02:32.039
I have to go with you.

18
02:36.560 --> 02:38.120
Don't you understand?

19
02:38.360 --> 02:40.159
Once our cover is blown,

20
02:40.639 --> 02:42.120
we might never make it back.

21
02:42.680 --> 02:43.360
I understand.

22
02:44.400 --> 02:45.599
Precisely because it's so dangerous,

23
02:45.759 --> 02:47.360
I can't let you take the risk alone.

24
02:56.960 --> 02:57.960
I know you care about me,

25
02:59.879 --> 03:01.039
and I want you to understand, too.

26
03:03.080 --> 03:03.479
I...

27
03:08.520 --> 03:09.439
We're partners.

28
03:13.319 --> 03:14.759
Partners should protect each other

29
03:15.039 --> 03:15.879
and watch each other's backs.

30
03:17.080 --> 03:17.800
When facing danger,

31
03:18.280 --> 03:19.840
why can't we face it together?

32
03:20.719 --> 03:22.039
Besides, on an undercover op,

33
03:23.599 --> 03:25.120
I don't want your inner loneliness

34
03:25.120 --> 03:25.960
to make you lose yourself.

35
03:27.919 --> 03:29.319
I want to go with you.

36
03:30.039 --> 03:30.919
With me by your side,

37
03:32.080 --> 03:33.240
at least you won't be alone.

38
03:50.000 --> 03:50.360
All right.

39
03:51.240 --> 03:52.919
But you have to promise me one thing.

40
03:54.319 --> 03:55.039
Once we get there,

41
03:56.120 --> 03:56.919
if there is danger,

42
03:57.360 --> 03:58.439
protect yourself first.

43
03:58.680 --> 03:59.800
No matter what happens to me,

44
03:59.960 --> 04:00.680
don't try to save me.

45
04:01.000 --> 04:02.039
All right, I promise.

46
04:02.759 --> 04:04.360
I need you to promise me, seriously.

47
04:12.199 --> 04:12.800
I promise.

48
04:14.080 --> 04:15.360
But you have to promise me too.

49
04:15.879 --> 04:16.800
Come back with me.

50
04:49.319 --> 04:50.360
Liang Wenbiao called and said

51
04:50.360 --> 04:51.519
the deal is set for 3:00 p.m. tomorrow.

52
04:52.040 --> 04:53.319
He'll let us know in advance

53
04:53.319 --> 04:54.040
the location of the deal.

54
04:54.920 --> 04:55.839
Did you make sure

55
04:55.839 --> 04:56.839
he has the money ready?

56
04:57.720 --> 04:59.360
Liang Wenbiao's worried online transfers

57
04:59.480 --> 05:00.279
might expose him down the road,

58
05:00.600 --> 05:01.639
so he insists on paying cash.

59
05:02.439 --> 05:02.959
Brother Qiang,

60
05:03.319 --> 05:04.839
do you think something's off?

61
05:05.040 --> 05:06.160
As long as he pays,

62
05:06.639 --> 05:07.759
I don't give a damn how he does it.

63
05:12.839 --> 05:14.240
Brother Qiang, I found out! I found out!

64
05:14.439 --> 05:15.040
Talk.

65
05:15.319 --> 05:16.920
The waiter at the cafe said

66
05:16.920 --> 05:18.079
that woman has a boyfriend,

67
05:18.319 --> 05:19.000
and he's a cop.

68
05:19.519 --> 05:21.079
I bet the one who ratted us out last time

69
05:21.079 --> 05:22.120
was definitely that woman.

70
05:40.920 --> 05:42.399
Li Xiao hasn't been doing too well lately.

71
05:43.920 --> 05:44.639
Find some time

72
05:45.439 --> 05:46.319
to give him a call.

73
05:59.680 --> 06:00.879
Sister Xin, someone's here to see you.

74
06:10.879 --> 06:11.560
Uncle Huang.

75
06:18.199 --> 06:19.480
Time really flies.

76
06:19.879 --> 06:21.360
In my memory,

77
06:22.040 --> 06:23.800
you were still only in third grade.

78
06:25.879 --> 06:27.240
Over a decade has flown by.

79
06:28.399 --> 06:29.319
How is your mother?

80
06:29.839 --> 06:30.759
She went back to our hometown.

81
06:31.240 --> 06:33.240
Grandma is old and needs care.

82
06:35.480 --> 06:36.639
When your father passed away,

83
06:37.000 --> 06:38.240
I tried visiting your mother a few times.

84
06:38.839 --> 06:40.040
She kept refusing to see me.

85
06:42.079 --> 06:44.040
I know she harbored resentment.

86
06:45.519 --> 06:47.279
If there is anything I could do for you...

87
06:48.839 --> 06:50.279
I understand your good intentions, Uncle Huang.

88
06:52.560 --> 06:55.040
But what could you really do?

89
06:57.959 --> 06:58.839
My deepest regret...

90
06:59.480 --> 07:00.879
...is failing to bring your father back.

91
07:07.680 --> 07:09.720
Whenever my mother thinks of my father,

92
07:11.079 --> 07:12.519
it isn't just grief.

93
07:13.759 --> 07:14.879
Mostly, it's hurt and resentment.

94
07:18.000 --> 07:19.279
Every time she looks back on the past,

95
07:19.959 --> 07:20.800
she can't help wondering

96
07:22.920 --> 07:24.480
if my father ever truly loved her.

97
07:25.120 --> 07:28.240
Why did he have the heart to abandon us

98
07:30.240 --> 07:32.240
and choose his duty without looking back?

99
07:34.160 --> 07:35.360
Back when I was in school,

100
07:36.040 --> 07:37.360
my classmates kept asking me,

101
07:38.839 --> 07:40.439
and I never knew how to answer them:

102
07:42.959 --> 07:44.120
"What does your father do?"

103
07:45.519 --> 07:46.279
"Where is he?"

104
07:50.560 --> 07:51.680
Sometimes I wonder,

105
07:53.120 --> 07:54.399
if from the moment I was born,

106
07:55.399 --> 07:57.120
I never even knew what he did,

107
07:57.120 --> 07:58.360
would things have been better?

108
08:04.959 --> 08:07.639
Your father loved you both very deeply.

109
08:09.000 --> 08:09.879
He once told me

110
08:11.000 --> 08:12.639
that marrying your mother

111
08:13.160 --> 08:14.279
was the greatest blessing of his life.

112
08:15.000 --> 08:17.079
Yet his blessing was my mother's sorrow.

113
08:20.399 --> 08:22.240
If only we could start over,

114
08:22.839 --> 08:24.600
I wish he hadn't been a cop,

115
08:25.720 --> 08:26.879
just an ordinary man.

116
08:26.879 --> 08:28.000
He could have done anything,

117
08:29.879 --> 08:32.360
as long as he stayed by our side.

118
08:36.080 --> 08:38.679
As a husband and a father,

119
08:39.519 --> 08:41.039
he truly owed you two so much.

120
08:41.840 --> 08:43.519
Yet he was a police officer after all,

121
08:43.919 --> 08:44.840
bearing a heavy responsibility.

122
08:46.639 --> 08:48.399
If his soul can see us from heaven,

123
08:49.080 --> 08:50.360
I believe his greatest wish

124
08:50.879 --> 08:53.039
would be to earn his family's forgiveness.

125
08:53.200 --> 08:55.240
During our joint border mission back then,

126
08:55.759 --> 08:56.679
we were all fully aware

127
08:56.679 --> 08:58.039
of how dangerous the assignment was.

128
08:58.320 --> 09:01.080
So we each wrote farewell letters home.

129
09:02.879 --> 09:04.639
After so many years,

130
09:05.120 --> 09:06.120
I believe your mother

131
09:06.279 --> 09:07.919
can finally find the courage to face it.

132
09:08.559 --> 09:09.320
And you as well.

133
09:09.960 --> 09:12.200
You should also understand the true meaning

134
09:12.200 --> 09:13.519
behind your father's farewell letter.

135
09:13.519 --> 09:15.200
The target of this operation

136
09:15.480 --> 09:18.679
is to capture drug ring leader Cheng Fei.

137
09:19.559 --> 09:22.840
Cheng Fei previously had numerous deals

138
09:23.080 --> 09:24.519
with Country M's Drug Lord, Jessadaborn.

139
09:25.519 --> 09:27.720
He possesses a vast amount of evidence

140
09:27.759 --> 09:29.080
incriminating Jessadaborn.

141
09:30.000 --> 09:31.840
But due to a deal conflict a year ago,

142
09:32.600 --> 09:34.919
Jessadaborn issued a Kill Order on Cheng Fei

143
09:35.480 --> 09:38.399
across Jiechan State.

144
09:38.639 --> 09:41.200
Cheng Fei's gang was hit hard by

145
09:41.360 --> 09:43.919
Jessadaborn and Country M's four cartels.

146
09:44.039 --> 09:45.399
According to our intelligence,

147
09:46.399 --> 09:49.600
Jessadaborn is already tracking Cheng Fei.

148
09:50.159 --> 09:52.399
Therefore, the key to this mission

149
09:52.799 --> 09:55.200
is that once you capture Cheng Fei,

150
09:55.519 --> 09:57.399
you must evade Jessadaborn's assassins

151
09:58.000 --> 09:59.919
and bring Cheng Fei back to me alive!

152
10:00.039 --> 10:00.960
Yes, sir!

153
10:02.240 --> 10:03.960
This seven-member tactical squad

154
10:04.960 --> 10:06.559
will be led by Tian Zheng,

155
10:06.720 --> 10:07.919
who will serve as overall field commander.

156
10:07.919 --> 10:08.279
Yes, sir!

157
10:09.360 --> 10:10.679
Huang Lie will serve as deputy leader.

158
10:12.080 --> 10:14.879
Is everyone clear on the mission?

159
10:15.039 --> 10:15.879
Understood!

160
10:15.960 --> 10:17.120
We will complete the mission!

161
10:17.759 --> 10:18.200
Good.

162
10:18.840 --> 10:19.639
Stay safe out there.

163
10:20.200 --> 10:22.120
I await your triumphant return.

164
10:36.919 --> 10:38.399
To my dearest wife and daughter,

165
10:39.279 --> 10:41.519
This letter may be

166
10:41.519 --> 10:42.799
my last words in this world.

167
10:44.120 --> 10:46.879
Tomorrow, I am ordered to join

168
10:47.159 --> 10:48.559
a secret border anti-drug operation.

169
10:50.279 --> 10:51.799
I am proud to take part in this mission,

170
10:52.679 --> 10:55.519
to protect our country and our people.

171
10:57.000 --> 10:57.759
Yet at the same time,

172
10:59.279 --> 11:00.720
I feel so guilty toward you both.

173
11:01.519 --> 11:04.120
To my wife, Aiyun,

174
11:05.519 --> 11:06.399
all these years,

175
11:08.000 --> 11:09.919
you quietly held our family together alone

176
11:11.320 --> 11:12.639
and raised our daughter.

177
11:15.039 --> 11:16.519
I know I owe you both so much.

178
11:17.919 --> 11:19.480
If I return safely this time,

179
11:20.919 --> 11:22.360
I will do everything in my power

180
11:23.600 --> 11:26.360
to take good care of you and Xiaoxin.

181
11:27.519 --> 11:28.919
But if the worst

182
11:30.159 --> 11:31.240
should happen to me,

183
11:31.919 --> 11:33.480
I hope you can find someone

184
11:33.480 --> 11:34.200
who treats you well,

185
11:35.679 --> 11:37.000
to spend the rest of your life with.

186
11:38.200 --> 11:39.519
To my beloved daughter, Xiaoxin,

187
11:40.519 --> 11:41.960
I know the greatest joy in childhood

188
11:43.080 --> 11:44.360
is having your parents by your side.

189
11:45.720 --> 11:47.000
Yet because of Daddy,

190
11:48.919 --> 11:50.399
we were rarely ever together.

191
11:50.879 --> 11:51.799
As a father,

192
11:52.879 --> 11:53.679
I have failed.

193
11:54.639 --> 11:58.000
Because Daddy was absent from your life,

194
11:59.320 --> 12:03.200
in time, I might slowly

195
12:04.559 --> 12:05.799
fade from your memory.

196
12:06.440 --> 12:08.639
Still, Daddy wants to tell you:

197
12:09.519 --> 12:12.559
You are Heaven's greatest gift to me.

198
12:14.559 --> 12:15.240
Xiaoxin,

199
12:16.519 --> 12:17.919
I hope when you grow up,

200
12:19.639 --> 12:22.759
you can feel proud that your father

201
12:25.120 --> 12:26.200
was a police officer.

202
13:15.759 --> 13:16.440
How many people?

203
13:17.279 --> 13:17.679
Three of us.

204
13:18.679 --> 13:19.519
Is everyone here?

205
13:19.919 --> 13:20.320
All here.

206
13:21.399 --> 13:22.200
200,000 each.

207
13:22.799 --> 13:23.919
If you're leaving, get on the boat now.

208
13:24.919 --> 13:25.480
Hold on a second.

209
13:27.240 --> 13:28.440
Once you reach Luang Prabang,

210
13:28.720 --> 13:29.600
someone will meet you

211
13:30.039 --> 13:31.159
and take you to Jiangyang.

212
13:31.879 --> 13:33.000
The trip from here to Jiangyang

213
13:33.159 --> 13:34.120
will take a full day and night.

214
13:34.440 --> 13:35.600
Be careful on the way.

215
13:35.799 --> 13:36.519
Thank you, Mr. Qin.

216
13:37.120 --> 13:39.559
Is my brother going to be alright?

217
13:42.639 --> 13:43.799
As soon as the factory was rented,

218
13:44.360 --> 13:45.559
the police arrived.

219
13:45.759 --> 13:46.840
It seems the Country M police

220
13:47.960 --> 13:49.759
have been watching Mr. Ma for a long time.

221
13:50.480 --> 13:51.919
But right now, I'm not sure

222
13:52.600 --> 13:54.519
how much evidence they have on him.

223
13:54.960 --> 13:55.960
Keep in mind, though,

224
13:56.600 --> 13:58.360
armed assault on police is a major felony.

225
13:59.440 --> 14:00.759
Once Mr. Ma is convicted,

226
14:02.240 --> 14:05.399
the chances of getting him out are...

227
14:10.559 --> 14:12.759
Miss Li is still in Jiang Liye's hands.

228
14:13.759 --> 14:15.000
Focus on the task at hand first.

229
14:15.279 --> 14:16.799
I'll figure something out regarding Mr. Ma.

230
14:17.519 --> 14:18.639
Once you get back,

231
14:19.039 --> 14:20.360
we'll work out a plan together

232
14:20.559 --> 14:21.679
to rescue him.

233
14:23.000 --> 14:24.399
While it's still dark,

234
14:24.600 --> 14:26.360
the water police are barely patrolling.

235
14:26.480 --> 14:27.799
Head out right now.

236
14:28.720 --> 14:29.159
Alright.

237
14:29.399 --> 14:31.799
I leave my brother to you, Mr. Qin.

238
14:32.519 --> 14:33.000
Don't worry.

239
14:33.720 --> 14:35.000
Go on. Safe travels.

240
14:35.759 --> 14:36.240
Let's go.

241
14:51.600 --> 14:51.919
Let's go.

242
14:58.200 --> 15:00.399
Any movement on Liang Wenbiao?

243
15:00.480 --> 15:01.679
The recent cases

244
15:01.679 --> 15:03.120
are all tied to Psychedelic Blues.

245
15:03.320 --> 15:05.039
Got any intel on your end?

246
15:06.799 --> 15:08.600
Liang Wenbiao and Li Qiang will deal soon.

247
15:09.480 --> 15:11.039
I don't know the exact time yet.

248
15:11.759 --> 15:12.759
I'll let you know once I get word.

249
15:15.120 --> 15:15.600
Don't take any risks.

250
15:16.919 --> 15:17.279
Hanging up.

251
15:39.240 --> 15:41.600
Enjoying the early breeze, Fourth Brother?

252
15:46.159 --> 15:49.080
This is a good spot to watch the sunrise.

253
15:54.320 --> 15:56.840
You didn't bring me here for the sunrise.

254
15:57.679 --> 15:59.039
If you want to see the sunrise,

255
15:59.440 --> 16:01.399
you have to sacrifice some sleep.

256
16:02.320 --> 16:04.919
Everything comes with a price.

257
16:04.919 --> 16:07.159
Even the most trivial things.

258
16:09.519 --> 16:12.000
Getting philosophical, Fourth Brother.

259
16:14.480 --> 16:15.240
Just spit it out.

260
16:15.519 --> 16:16.720
What do you really want from me?

261
16:17.240 --> 16:17.759
Nothing really.

262
16:18.440 --> 16:20.159
Just missed you after so long.

263
16:22.679 --> 16:23.600
That said,

264
16:23.919 --> 16:25.159
usually around this time,

265
16:25.879 --> 16:27.440
you'd be coming to me for goods.

266
16:28.639 --> 16:30.600
Yet you look pretty relaxed right now.

267
16:31.360 --> 16:32.000
So,

268
16:33.080 --> 16:34.279
business is bad?

269
16:37.120 --> 16:39.120
Business is great, actually.

270
16:40.840 --> 16:42.639
It's just that your supply,

271
16:43.360 --> 16:44.559
are a bit pricey.

272
16:52.120 --> 16:54.600
So you got your supply from someone else.

273
16:55.480 --> 16:56.200
Here's what happened.

274
16:56.279 --> 16:57.679
Some chump was skipping town

275
16:58.200 --> 17:00.879
and dumped all his stash on me dirt cheap.

276
17:00.879 --> 17:02.519
With a deal like that,

277
17:03.879 --> 17:05.119
how could I say no?

278
17:09.000 --> 17:11.680
Business is all about making money.

279
17:11.680 --> 17:13.920
Still, we've known each other for so long.

280
17:13.920 --> 17:14.960
When something this good comes up,

281
17:14.960 --> 17:16.599
you didn't even give me a heads-up?

282
17:21.759 --> 17:22.920
You want to make money,

283
17:23.519 --> 17:24.559
and I won't stop you.

284
17:26.440 --> 17:27.640
But on this deal,

285
17:28.440 --> 17:30.000
you have to cut me in.

286
18:16.920 --> 18:17.599
Tian Xin.

287
18:23.240 --> 18:24.240
Can you hear me?

288
18:25.279 --> 18:26.240
Can you hear me?

289
18:28.599 --> 18:29.400
Li Xiao.

290
18:33.680 --> 18:35.480
I want to tell you...

291
18:36.480 --> 18:37.079
I...

292
18:40.920 --> 18:41.799
Can you hear me?

293
18:46.200 --> 18:47.039
Can you hear me?

294
18:49.240 --> 18:50.240
I'm on the train right now.

295
18:50.240 --> 18:51.160
The signal's bad here.

296
18:55.640 --> 18:56.240
What did you say?

297
20:33.200 --> 20:34.200
You really made quite a name for yourself.

298
20:34.599 --> 20:36.039
The whole force is talking about

299
20:36.039 --> 20:37.680
your feat of taking down Huang Weiguang.

300
20:38.680 --> 20:39.880
That's only because our entire team

301
20:39.920 --> 20:41.200
is full of brave fighters.

302
20:46.079 --> 20:47.000
Why didn't that kid Lao Zhuang

303
20:48.039 --> 20:48.759
come pick me up?

304
20:49.240 --> 20:50.599
Said he had a special assignment.

305
20:50.839 --> 20:52.200
He and Ge Dan were both reassigned.

306
20:52.319 --> 20:53.039
Reassigned?

307
20:54.599 --> 20:55.920
We just made progress on Qian Feng's case.

308
20:55.920 --> 20:57.279
Why reassign the lead investigators?

309
20:57.759 --> 20:59.440
I have no idea about that.

310
20:59.920 --> 21:01.400
Right now, besides Captain Bai and Lu,

311
21:01.440 --> 21:02.880
everyone else is completely in the dark.

312
21:03.759 --> 21:04.319
Let's go.

313
21:04.359 --> 21:05.640
We're calling an emergency meeting.

314
21:14.160 --> 21:15.160
According to the latest intel,

315
21:15.799 --> 21:16.920
Liang Wenbiao and Li Qiang

316
21:17.000 --> 21:19.119
will make a deal at three this afternoon.

317
21:19.880 --> 21:21.480
The location hasn't been confirmed yet.

318
21:22.359 --> 21:23.359
Based on my assessment,

319
21:23.559 --> 21:24.480
Liang Wenbiao and his crew

320
21:24.720 --> 21:27.440
will depart from the Black Panther Club.

321
21:27.799 --> 21:29.440
So we're setting up surveillance early.

322
21:30.759 --> 21:33.279
We're split into Teams A, B, and C.

323
21:33.680 --> 21:35.160
Li Xiao will lead Team A

324
21:35.519 --> 21:37.519
and stake out near the Black Panther Club.

325
21:39.039 --> 21:40.000
Guan Qiang, Captain Lu,

326
21:40.559 --> 21:42.319
you will lead Teams B and C,

327
21:42.720 --> 21:45.160
on standby at intersections by the Club.

328
21:48.559 --> 21:49.000
Sorry.

329
21:53.799 --> 21:55.200
I'm in a meeting. I'll call you back.

330
21:56.920 --> 21:57.480
What's going on?

331
22:00.720 --> 22:01.119
I...

332
22:02.039 --> 22:02.880
something came up at home.

333
22:03.039 --> 22:03.599
Need some time off?

334
22:04.359 --> 22:04.759
No, I'm good.

335
22:07.039 --> 22:07.519
Hand it over.

336
22:09.799 --> 22:10.599
Hand it over.

337
22:23.839 --> 22:25.079
For this operation, we'll deploy

338
22:25.079 --> 22:26.599
three teams rotating surveillance

339
22:26.880 --> 22:29.160
until we reach Liang Wenbiao's deal site.

340
22:29.319 --> 22:29.839
Any questions?

341
22:30.200 --> 22:30.680
All clear.

342
22:31.759 --> 22:32.200
Move out.

343
22:38.319 --> 22:38.880
You kid.

344
22:39.480 --> 22:41.079
Don't let dating interfere with work.

345
23:19.960 --> 23:21.400
Liang Wenbiao is on his way to the club.

346
23:21.799 --> 23:22.359
What a coincidence.

347
24:14.880 --> 24:15.880
When the deal goes down later,

348
24:16.039 --> 24:17.519
make sure you see the goods before paying.

349
24:22.359 --> 24:22.759
Brother Biao,

350
24:24.200 --> 24:25.039
what took you so long?

351
24:25.039 --> 24:25.799
Got stuck in traffic.

352
24:36.319 --> 24:36.839
Ah Kai,

353
24:37.000 --> 24:37.640
during the deal later,

354
24:37.640 --> 24:38.440
stay sharp.

355
24:39.359 --> 24:40.559
If anything feels off,

356
24:40.839 --> 24:41.480
strike first.

357
24:41.799 --> 24:42.319
Got it.

358
25:08.519 --> 25:09.720
Okay, okay, got it.

359
25:14.519 --> 25:15.599
Hand over your phones.

360
25:19.640 --> 25:20.599
Seriously, Brother Biao?

361
25:21.680 --> 25:23.279
My girl's gonna call me soon.

362
25:23.519 --> 25:24.440
What if she can't reach me?

363
25:30.559 --> 25:32.039
You got a death wish?

364
25:33.279 --> 25:34.519
Brother Biao, Brother Biao!

365
25:34.960 --> 25:36.200
Just kidding! I'll hand it over!

366
25:37.279 --> 25:37.640
I'll hand it over!

367
25:38.880 --> 25:39.200
Here!

368
26:04.240 --> 26:05.319
Suspect vehicle is leaving the club.

369
26:05.880 --> 26:06.920
Team A, begin pursuit.

370
26:16.720 --> 26:17.160
Go after them!

371
26:29.079 --> 26:29.799
All units, be advised.

372
26:30.039 --> 26:31.440
Keep mobile surveillance on the suspect.

373
26:44.400 --> 26:45.480
Tell your boss

374
26:45.680 --> 26:46.759
I'm already on my way.

375
26:47.799 --> 26:49.599
I'll be there in 20 minutes.

376
26:49.880 --> 26:51.039
Got it.

377
26:55.519 --> 26:56.559
We should get moving.

378
27:01.640 --> 27:02.079
Brother Qiang.

379
27:03.680 --> 27:04.279
It's time to go.

380
27:07.079 --> 27:08.680
We have to be extra careful with this deal.

381
27:09.960 --> 27:10.599
I'll get the car.

382
27:34.599 --> 27:35.599
Turn right up ahead.

383
27:35.599 --> 27:36.440
Loop around again.

384
27:37.279 --> 27:37.680
Turn right.

385
27:38.319 --> 27:39.440
Turning right is going the long way, bro.

386
27:40.279 --> 27:41.240
What the hell do you know?

387
27:41.920 --> 27:43.480
How else will we know if we've got a tail?

388
27:57.039 --> 27:58.359
The suspect changed to the side road.

389
27:58.519 --> 27:59.640
Team A can't stay on them.

390
28:00.799 --> 28:01.400
Team B, take over.

391
28:02.200 --> 28:02.799
Copy that.

392
28:02.960 --> 28:03.359
Stay on them.

393
28:03.359 --> 28:03.720
On it.

394
28:21.079 --> 28:21.680
Team B, pull out.

395
28:22.319 --> 28:22.839
Team A, stay on them.

396
28:23.400 --> 28:23.920
Copy.

397
28:24.359 --> 28:24.720
Copy that.

398
28:47.519 --> 28:47.799
Bro,

399
28:49.000 --> 28:50.480
once we pass the intersection up ahead,

400
28:50.640 --> 28:51.880
turn right and we're there.

401
28:52.079 --> 28:54.119
Dana and I will go deal with Li Qiang.

402
28:55.279 --> 28:55.759
Ah Kai,

403
28:56.720 --> 28:58.880
don't stick too close to us later.

404
28:59.200 --> 29:01.200
Go down and scope out the surroundings.

405
29:01.359 --> 29:02.319
Your job is

406
29:02.480 --> 29:03.920
to keep our brothers safe.

407
29:04.319 --> 29:05.559
Once we get the goods...

408
29:11.799 --> 29:12.119
Speak.

409
29:13.799 --> 29:16.119
We've got a tail. Circle around again.

410
29:18.680 --> 29:19.119
Got it.

411
29:28.000 --> 29:29.079
What is it, Brother Biao?

412
29:30.599 --> 29:32.119
Ah Wei, circle around again.

413
29:50.720 --> 29:51.759
The suspect's vehicle has already passed

414
29:51.759 --> 29:53.119
two parking lot entrances.

415
29:55.160 --> 29:56.680
It's not Financial City.

416
29:57.799 --> 29:58.839
We guessed wrong again.

417
30:12.319 --> 30:13.640
Team B is still at the intersection ahead.

418
30:13.920 --> 30:14.559
What do we do?

419
30:15.400 --> 30:16.000
Keep driving.

420
30:36.599 --> 30:38.599
Brother Biao, what's wrong?

421
30:40.400 --> 30:40.960
Nothing.

422
30:41.119 --> 30:42.599
Something just feels off today.

423
30:44.440 --> 30:44.920
Boss,

424
30:45.920 --> 30:48.599
you don't think the cops are tailing us?

425
30:52.079 --> 30:54.000
I suspect it's not just the cops.

426
31:04.039 --> 31:05.039
All right, got it.

427
31:07.640 --> 31:09.240
The cops are onto Liang Wenbiao.

428
31:09.640 --> 31:10.559
Today's deal is off.

429
31:17.119 --> 31:18.720
Cut contact with them for now.

430
31:20.920 --> 31:21.680
Still...

431
31:21.680 --> 31:23.680
the boss wants us to dump the stash soon

432
31:23.680 --> 31:24.799
and meet him in Country M.

433
31:24.799 --> 31:26.119
If Liang Wenbiao falls through,

434
31:26.960 --> 31:28.240
should we look for other buyers?

435
31:28.839 --> 31:30.920
Buyers in Nanhai who can take this much...

436
31:30.920 --> 31:31.680
There aren't many.

437
31:31.880 --> 31:32.359
Besides,

438
31:33.079 --> 31:34.279
the more buyers we deal with,

439
31:34.279 --> 31:35.440
the more likely we'll be exposed.

440
31:37.839 --> 31:39.400
Should we call Yunfei

441
31:39.559 --> 31:40.799
and ask how things are going in Jiangyang?

442
31:44.039 --> 31:45.599
Jiangyang police received an informant tip

443
31:45.839 --> 31:48.039
that suspect Xiao Yunfei entered our city.

444
31:48.359 --> 31:50.680
They immediately launched an operation.

445
32:11.839 --> 32:12.480
Get up.

446
32:12.759 --> 32:13.400
Take them all in.

447
32:14.079 --> 32:14.519
Move.

448
32:15.759 --> 32:16.119
Hurry up!

449
32:20.839 --> 32:21.200
Captain.

450
32:21.519 --> 32:22.680
Three drug traffickers captured on site.

451
32:23.079 --> 32:24.400
The other three were all shot dead.

452
32:34.160 --> 32:35.200
Once the case details are compiled,

453
32:35.440 --> 32:36.759
report to the Provincial Dept immediately.

454
32:36.880 --> 32:37.200
Yes, sir.

455
32:56.039 --> 32:57.359
How are things on your end?

456
32:58.000 --> 32:59.039
Pretty good.

457
32:59.359 --> 33:00.200
He had too much to drink.

458
33:00.720 --> 33:02.640
Why? Is something wrong?

459
33:03.279 --> 33:04.799
Want me to wake him up for you?

460
33:05.279 --> 33:06.319
No, no, no need.

461
33:06.880 --> 33:07.799
Just tell him

462
33:08.400 --> 33:09.240
once he wakes up

463
33:09.240 --> 33:10.599
to give home a call.

464
33:11.160 --> 33:12.960
Sure, once he wakes up.

465
33:19.799 --> 33:20.519
Run this number.

466
33:20.839 --> 33:21.319
Yes, sir.

467
33:26.920 --> 33:28.079
Something happened to Yunfei.

468
33:48.880 --> 33:50.559
The suspect suddenly called off the deal.

469
33:51.920 --> 33:54.039
I suspect that while we were tailing them,

470
33:54.039 --> 33:55.039
we accidentally blew our cover.

471
33:56.720 --> 33:58.519
Today's operation was tightly planned.

472
33:59.200 --> 34:01.000
Three teams took turns tailing them.

473
34:01.599 --> 34:02.359
Logically,

474
34:02.759 --> 34:04.359
we shouldn't have been spotted so easily.

475
34:06.880 --> 34:07.880
I can't be sure either.

476
34:08.280 --> 34:08.880
But...

477
34:10.000 --> 34:12.239
based on what we know of Liang's gang,

478
34:13.360 --> 34:14.639
他们的反侦查能力

479
34:14.840 --> 34:15.840
aren't actually that strong.

480
34:16.119 --> 34:17.360
Yet for some reason,

481
34:17.880 --> 34:19.280
right from the start of the operation,

482
34:19.920 --> 34:21.679
we lost contact with our undercover.

483
34:22.039 --> 34:23.760
Looks like they're getting more cautious.

484
34:25.559 --> 34:27.480
I bet during the next deal,

485
34:28.199 --> 34:29.480
they'll be even more guarded.

486
34:30.599 --> 34:33.559
We can only wait to reach the undercover

487
34:34.039 --> 34:36.360
to find out why.

488
34:38.000 --> 34:39.199
Still can't reach the undercover officer?

489
34:40.480 --> 34:40.880
No.

490
34:42.280 --> 34:43.079
Could the cover be blown?

491
34:43.679 --> 34:44.159
I don't know.

492
34:46.280 --> 34:47.360
But I'm really worried.

493
35:04.239 --> 35:05.239
Ruined my plans.

494
35:12.079 --> 35:13.360
Boss, please calm down.

495
35:19.320 --> 35:19.719
Brother Biao.

496
35:20.719 --> 35:22.119
Why are you looking at us like that?

497
35:28.519 --> 35:28.880
Whose is this?

498
35:29.559 --> 35:30.119
Mine.

499
35:30.800 --> 35:31.440
It's a phone I just bought.

500
35:33.880 --> 35:34.440
Unlock it.

501
35:46.159 --> 35:46.920
Dana,

502
35:47.320 --> 35:48.159
it's not even dark yet,

503
35:48.159 --> 35:49.039
and you're calling me.

504
35:49.639 --> 35:50.039
What's up?

505
35:50.280 --> 35:51.599
Got some good stuff again?

506
35:56.159 --> 35:56.519
Who is it?

507
35:57.360 --> 35:58.920
It's that kid from Yunding Pool Hall.

508
35:59.239 --> 36:00.320
He wants to score some stuff from me.

509
36:01.119 --> 36:03.000
Boss, you've met him?

510
36:13.960 --> 36:15.320
Boss, here's my phone.

511
36:20.920 --> 36:21.519
Passcode.

512
36:22.519 --> 36:23.239
Three-three-five-six.

513
36:31.199 --> 36:33.119
Xiaokang, what is it?

514
36:33.159 --> 36:34.039
Miss me already?

515
36:35.039 --> 36:36.920
This—this is my girlfriend.

516
36:40.119 --> 36:41.800
Tonight, Xiaokang...

517
36:42.000 --> 36:43.639
...went on a date with another woman.

518
36:45.119 --> 36:46.280
No, Boss, she...

519
36:48.400 --> 36:49.440
Boss, come on...

520
36:49.679 --> 36:50.440
Go on, go have your date.

521
36:52.039 --> 36:52.880
Get moving already.

522
36:54.079 --> 36:54.920
Thanks, Boss.

523
36:55.159 --> 36:55.639
I'm off then.

524
36:57.119 --> 36:57.880
Babe...

525
36:58.119 --> 36:59.079
Don't be mad, don't be mad.

526
36:59.519 --> 37:00.519
Boss was just messing with you.

527
37:02.079 --> 37:02.559
Brother Biao.

528
37:03.199 --> 37:03.719
Here's mine.

529
37:04.039 --> 37:04.519
No passcode.

530
37:05.079 --> 37:07.000
I only called my mom this morning.

531
37:07.199 --> 37:09.960
If you speak with her later,

532
37:10.639 --> 37:11.559
please try to be polite.

533
37:43.519 --> 37:46.159
Your call logs and text messages—

534
37:47.119 --> 37:48.480
why are they completely blank?

535
37:49.480 --> 37:51.159
I've spoken with Weizi and Dana on the phone.

536
37:52.239 --> 37:53.360
If, during the deal,

537
37:53.360 --> 37:53.920
I get busted,

538
37:54.400 --> 37:56.320
at least the cops won't find you so fast.

539
38:03.559 --> 38:04.400
Smart move.

540
38:06.079 --> 38:08.920
Take notes from Ah Kai from now on.

541
38:10.119 --> 38:10.800
Yes, Brother Biao.

542
38:15.840 --> 38:16.480
All right, that's enough.

543
38:16.599 --> 38:17.880
Everyone's had a long day today.

544
38:18.199 --> 38:18.840
Head back early.

545
38:19.960 --> 38:20.599
We're taking off, Brother Biao.

546
38:24.559 --> 38:25.280
Ah Kai,

547
38:26.960 --> 38:27.639
stay behind for a moment.

548
38:31.440 --> 38:33.039
Today's operation was leaked.

549
38:34.039 --> 38:35.679
There are indeed many suspicious details.

550
38:37.920 --> 38:39.280
Have traffic control pull up today's...

551
38:39.280 --> 38:41.000
...surveillance footage along the routes.

552
38:41.400 --> 38:42.440
See what they turn up.

553
38:48.679 --> 38:50.039
We've spooked the targets this time,

554
38:50.519 --> 38:52.719
who knows when they'll deal again.

555
38:54.000 --> 38:55.079
Once you reach the undercover,

556
38:55.559 --> 38:56.800
confirm his safety first.

557
38:57.079 --> 38:59.199
If there's any risk of his cover blowing,

558
38:59.679 --> 39:00.880
order him to abort immediately.

559
39:02.159 --> 39:02.599
Yes, sir!

560
39:07.800 --> 39:09.480
As for Qian Feng and the logistics firm,

561
39:10.119 --> 39:10.920
we need to speed that up as well.

562
39:12.719 --> 39:14.800
Zhuang Yan and Ge Dan's investigation—

563
39:15.119 --> 39:16.679
hand it over to Li Xiao for now.

564
39:17.760 --> 39:18.079
Yes, sir!

565
39:36.599 --> 39:38.079
Do you know why I had you stay?

566
39:41.000 --> 39:42.480
The cops tailed us today.

567
39:45.320 --> 39:46.760
There's a Mole among us.

568
39:48.719 --> 39:49.199
Ah Kai,

569
39:49.880 --> 39:51.360
help me break this down.

570
39:51.840 --> 39:53.119
Out of these few guys,

571
39:53.840 --> 39:54.880
who could be the Mole?

572
39:58.880 --> 40:01.079
Weizi has been with you the longest.

573
40:02.320 --> 40:03.199
It definitely can't be him.

574
40:03.599 --> 40:05.679
Dana knows all your businesses,

575
40:06.119 --> 40:08.400
and he even runs the casino himself.

576
40:09.199 --> 40:10.480
If he were the Mole,

577
40:10.800 --> 40:12.719
the cops would've nailed you long ago.

578
40:13.079 --> 40:14.119
They wouldn't have waited until now.

579
40:15.800 --> 40:16.559
Xiaokang,

580
40:18.039 --> 40:18.840
it can't be him either.

581
40:20.119 --> 40:21.639
Though he's been with you the shortest,

582
40:22.960 --> 40:23.920
he has a criminal record.

583
40:24.960 --> 40:27.360
That record is just what he claims.

584
40:29.440 --> 40:31.719
That kid runs with a sketchy crowd.

585
40:35.280 --> 40:35.960
Ah Kai,

586
40:36.199 --> 40:36.639
here's what we'll do.

587
40:37.119 --> 40:38.440
Look into Xiaokang for me.

588
40:41.159 --> 40:43.079
I hope my suspicion is wrong.

589
40:45.079 --> 40:46.639
But then again,

590
40:47.079 --> 40:48.599
if he really is the Mole,

591
40:52.440 --> 40:54.239
I'll turn him into a ghost first.

592
40:57.039 --> 40:57.559
I'll handle it.

593
41:19.000 --> 41:21.599
The Mekong is Asia's largest river system,

594
41:21.880 --> 41:24.840
crossing China, Country M, Laos, Cambodia,

595
41:25.039 --> 41:25.679
and Vietnam.

596
41:27.800 --> 41:29.519
What we often call Jiechan State

597
41:30.360 --> 41:32.960
lies at the border of Country M, Laos, and Thailand,

598
41:33.039 --> 41:35.559
covering 194,000 square kilometers.

599
41:35.639 --> 41:36.519
For a long time,

600
41:36.960 --> 41:38.119
this place has been rife with

601
41:38.119 --> 41:40.400
rebels and armed drug syndicates,

602
41:41.519 --> 41:43.280
and is known among criminals as

603
41:43.400 --> 41:44.599
a paradise for adventurers.

604
43:06.400 --> 43:07.760
Shift's over. Why aren't you home yet?

605
43:13.639 --> 43:14.239
What's wrong?

606
43:15.199 --> 43:16.039
Can't write it?

607
43:17.000 --> 43:18.760
Want to borrow my old resignation letter

608
43:18.760 --> 43:19.800
for reference?
